    <string name="licenses_text">Lumo Browser is MIT-licensed.\n\nIt uses: AndroidX and Jetpack Compose (Apache 2.0), Kotlin and kotlinx libraries (Apache 2.0), OkHttp (Apache 2.0), Room and DataStore (Apache 2.0). Pages are rendered by Android System WebView (Chromium, BSD-style licenses), which is provided by your device.\n\nOptional filter list: StevenBlack/hosts (MIT), downloaded only when you choose to update it.</string>
